---
import ProjectPage from "../components/ProjectPage.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../CSS/qausal.css";
import SingleFlyingObject from "../components/SingleFlyingObject.astro";
---

<Layout slug="qausal">
  <ProjectPage slug="qausal">
    <div class="grid_cell project-page_grid_title">
      <div class="grid_cell_container">
        <h1 class="full-col-text page-title">Qausal</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid_cell project-page_grid_category dev first">
      <div class="grid_cell_container">
        <span class="half-col-text">Dev</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid_cell project-page_grid_category ux second">
      <div class="grid_cell_container">
        <span class="half-col-text">UX</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid_cell project-page_grid_description">
      <div class="grid_cell_container">
        <p class="half-col-text justified-paragraph">
          During my internship abroad, I got the chance to create both a logo
          and a keynote presentation for a scientist specialised in particle
          acceleration.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid_cell project-page_grid_icon">
      <div class="grid_cell_container">
        <SingleFlyingObject slug="qausal" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-image image-1">
      <img src="/assets/qausal/logo-still.webp" />
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-video video-1 border">
      <video
        src="/assets/qausal/ANIMATION-logo.mp4"
        autoplay
        loop
        muted
        playsinline></video>
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-video video-2">
      <video
        src="/assets/qausal/ANIMATION-elements-3.mp4"
        autoplay
        loop
        muted
        playsinline></video>
    </div>
    <div class="grid_cell project-page_grid_paragraph paragraph-1">
      <div class="grid_cell_container">
        <p class="third-col-text justified-paragraph">
          Although the end-product of the project was a keynote presentation to
          secure funding—on paper, not the most exciting graphic problem—I still
          managed to experiment and find a brand I both really liked and trusted
          to be appropriate for its intended use.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-image image-2 border">
      <img src="/assets/qausal/laptop.webp" />
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-image image-3">
      <img src="/assets/qausal/double-screens.webp" />
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-video video-3 full-width">
      <video
        src="/assets/qausal/ANIMATION-elements-1.mp4"
        autoplay
        loop
        muted
        playsinline></video>
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-image image-4">
      <img src="/assets/qausal/book.webp" />
    </div>
    <div class="grid_cell project-page_grid_paragraph paragraph-2">
      <div class="grid_cell_container">
        <p class="third-col-text justified-paragraph">
          The keynote had to be visual pleasing and modern, but above all, the
          ideas expressed in it had to be clear. This was a challenge, since the
          ideas were extremely complex. I had to create something without truly
          understanding the content I was using. It meant putting a lot of care
          into the layout of the keynote and frequent meetings with the
          scientist himself.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-video video-4 border">
      <video
        src="/assets/qausal/ANIMATION-elements-2.mp4"
        autoplay
        loop
        muted
        playsinline></video>
    </div>
    <div class="project-page-image image-5">
      <img src="/assets/qausal/big-screen.webp" />
    </div>
  </ProjectPage>
</Layout>
